  {%- comment -%} ===== FALLBACK ===== {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    No exact match found — try the value itself as a CSS/handle-safe string.
    This lets valid CSS color names (e.g. "olive", "teal") work automatically,
    and gracefully degrades for unknown custom names.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {% assign hex = color_value | replace: ' ', '' %}

